0 FILE model.ldr
0 Rectangular Table with Four Legs and Four Minifigures
0 Name: model.ldr
0 Author: Maister Builder
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see CAreadme.txt

0 // === TABLE ===
0 // Table top - Plate 4 x 8 in reddish brown (colour 70)
1 70 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3035.dat

0 // Four legs - Brick 1 x 1 in dark bluish grey (colour 72)
1 72 -70 8 -30 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3005.dat
1 72 70 8 -30 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3005.dat
1 72 -70 8 30 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3005.dat
1 72 70 8 30 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3005.dat

0 === MINIFIGURES ===

0 // Minifig on front short side — red torso, black legs
1 16 0 32 -50 -1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 -1 minifig1.ldr

0 // Minifig on back short side — green torso, dark bluish grey legs
1 16 0 32 50 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 minifig2.ldr

0 // Minifig on left long side — yellow torso, blue legs
1 16 -90 32 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 1 0 0 minifig3.ldr

0 // Minifig on right long side — white torso, reddish brown legs
1 16 90 32 0 0 0 1 0 1 0 -1 0 0 minifig4.ldr

